  "pseudocode": "1. Build adjacency list\n2. Initialize discoveryTimes and lowLinks to -1\n3. DFS(u, parent):\n4.   set discoveryTime[u] = lowLink[u] = time++\n5.   for v in neighbors(u):\n6.     if v == parent: continue\n7.     if visited(v): lowLink[u] = min(lowLink[u], discoveryTime[v])\n8.     else: DFS(v, u), lowLink[u] = min(lowLink[u], lowLink[v]), if lowLink[v] > discoveryTime[u]: addBridge(u, v)",
